# Graphify — the canonical code graph, its report, and community labels are
# committed and shared. Everything else under graphify-out/ is local build
# state (extraction cache, incremental manifest, the regenerable HTML viz, and
# dated snapshots) and stays out of git.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!graphify-out/.graphify_labels.json
# Local, machine-specific interpreter marker.
/.graphify_*

# Go build/test output
*.out
vendor/
